  Name: Dynamite Fish
  WeightRange:
    MinWeight: 0.25
    MaxWeight: 5
  Difficulty: 5
  Biography: 'Although it looks like this fish has fused with some sticks of dynamite,
    the cylinders around its body are actually hardened ballasts that let the dynamite
    swim at great depths for its size, as well as protect from predators. The dynamite
    fish typically comes with a symbiotic parasite that attaches to these ballasts,
    creating an even more dynamite looking appearance. These parasites leech off
    of the nutrient-rich ballast water, in exchange for its bio-luminescent frills
    that attract prey for the host when in dark environments. '
